>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>  because some lines will intersect the curve at more than one point.</li>\n</ul>\n<div id=\"graphic-q-36039-e-1\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"https://mathacademy.com/graphics/q-36039-e-1\"></div>\n\n\n<p>Therefore, the correct answer is \"I and II only\". </p>\n<div class=\"studentAnswerHeader\">Your Answer:</div><div class=\"studentAnswer\">II only\n</div></div>",
